# #5851 R4 (a5e2e2ef's F1-F7): an idle leaf's read-only report fetch carries every bound an
# append response carries, for the closes the leaf carries.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFetchReportReaderWithoutCarriedClose
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
PERTURBS: FetchReport
SUMMARY: the fetch carries the leaf's carried close only for an activation that has claimed; a pre-arm reader fetches without it, so the WAL reports it no stale high, a stale donor's routed write lies below the fetched head, and the reader free-advances past it unapplied
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, WithReportFetch = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, ReportU)]
    /\ ReportStale(a)
    /\ ft' = [ft EXCEPT ![a] = next - 1]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: an unclaimed reader's fetch carries no close.
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, ReportU)]
    /\ IF claimed[a] THEN ReportStale(a) ELSE UNCHANGED seenS
    /\ ft' = [ft EXCEPT ![a] = next - 1]
--- END
